<p>So this feels like a few common tropes thrown together: monster/human hybrid (which was Lovecraft's allegory for mixed race relations, because he was a horrible racist), a reality bender, using an anomaly to &quot;get rid of other anomalies&quot;, a spooky cult with ties to the SCP's origins&#8230; etc.</p>
<p>For those reasons, as it stands this isn't something I would greenlight.</p>
<p>Yes, things that have been done before could be made to work, but only with a unique twist.</p>
<p>I would suggest you read a lot more articles to see what sorts of things work on the site nowadays, as opposed to what worked on the site back in its origins.</p>

